        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVSGR-ONE, Extra Long Fifth Avenue S Grip Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Fifth Avenue Handleset with S Grip is ideal for bigger doors; because of its larger than normal height of 19 inches, this entry set will stand out on even the largest of front doors. The Extra Long Fifth Avenue S Grip Entry Set will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Fifth Avenue One-Piece S Grip Entry Set is available in the most popular designer finishes and comes with your choice of interior trim knob or lever. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Extra Large Fifth Avenue Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5th Avenue S Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVSONE-specifications.pdf?v=1704262362\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue S-Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Fifth Avenue Handleset with S Grip",
                "description": "The Traditional Fifth Avenue Handleset with S Grip is ideal for bigger doors; because of its larger than normal height of 19 inches, this entry set will stand out on even the largest of front doors. The Extra Long Fifth Avenue S Grip Entry Set will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Fifth Avenue One-Piece S Grip Entry Set is available in the most popular designer finishes and comes with your choice of interior trim knob or lever. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.",
